<p>Your home is usually your largest investment, and a <strong>residential property insurance claim in San Marcos</strong> is rarely as simple as one adjuster visit and one check. A spring hailstorm can damage the roof, gutters, window screens, and fence in a single afternoon. A burst pipe can soak drywall, cabinets, flooring, and the furniture sitting on it. As a San Marcos public adjuster, we work only for the policyholder, helping homeowners and residential landlords understand their coverage, document the full loss, and present a claim the insurer can evaluate line by line.</p>

<h2>Residential Claims We Help With in San Marcos</h2>
<p>We assist owners of single-family homes, duplexes and small multi-unit rentals, townhomes, and rural properties across Hays County and nearby communities. Common causes of loss include:</p>
<ul>
