<li><strong>Fire and smoke:</strong> structure, contents, and odor or soot cleanup. See <a href="/services/fire-damage-claims/">fire damage claims</a>.</li>
<li><strong>Fallen trees and impact:</strong> limbs through the roof, damaged fences, and carports.</li>
</ul>
